    One way a default curve may be built. A DefaultCurve either writes its
    settings inline, or lists them as Configurations, each with a priority; ORE
    builds the first configuration that succeeds. The corpus writes 144 curves
    inline and 189 with configurations, nine of them with two, and never both. Each
    inline curve is one row with is_inline set; each listed configuration is one
    row with its priority.
